WEBVTT

00:00:02.013 --> 00:00:05.813
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:06.251 --> 00:00:10.085
Todoke Message

00:00:10.488 --> 00:00:19.419
'Itsudemo anata wo Shinjiteirukara'

00:00:20.198 --> 00:00:20.699
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.699 --> 00:00:28.740
The Story of Saiunkoku
Ano toki yume ni miteita
Sekai ni tatteirunoni

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.069
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.274 --> 00:00:36.476
Miwatasu keshiki ni
Ashi wo sukoshi sukumase

00:00:36.848 --> 00:00:40.978
Dakedo ushiro furimukanaide

00:00:41.086 --> 00:00:45.079
Aruiteyuku koto
Kimeta kara

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:49.486
Miageta sora
Nana iro no niji

00:00:49.661 --> 00:00:53.062
Anata mo mitemasuka?

00:00:53.398 --> 00:00:57.391
Hajimari no kaze yo

00:00:57.702 --> 00:01:01.468
Todoke Message

00:01:01.873 --> 00:01:10.042
Yumeni kakedashita senaka
Mimamoru kara

00:01:10.482 --> 00:01:14.418
Maiagaru kaze yo

00:01:14.819 --> 00:01:18.619
Hi no hikari matoi

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:28.522
Jiyuu no tsubasa de
Tsuyoku tobitatou

00:01:32.637 --> 00:01:35.105
Shurei's group is now only
a short distance from Koren...

00:01:35.173 --> 00:01:37.505
...the capital of
Sa Province where the...

00:01:38.209 --> 00:01:40.677
...swearing-in ceremony for the
provincial governors will take place.

00:01:41.045 --> 00:01:43.013
In Koren, that man of interest,
Sakujun Sa...

00:01:43.081 --> 00:01:45.549
...has been awaiting Shurei's arrival.

00:01:49.821 --> 00:01:52.289
However, with Koren under
a complete blockade...

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:56.586
...Shurei's group is stuck,
with the town in sight.

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:04.290
Women are Brave

00:02:08.106 --> 00:02:10.301
It's been thoroughly
blockaded, hasn't it?

00:02:11.176 --> 00:02:12.143
Yeah.

00:02:12.977 --> 00:02:17.038
But the swearing-in ceremony is
supposed to be held in Koren...

00:02:17.782 --> 00:02:20.182
And the day after that is their
deadline to arrive.

00:02:20.251 --> 00:02:23.243
If they're late, they're deemed to have
abandoned the assignment.

00:02:23.321 --> 00:02:24.811
Both Princess and
Eigetsu will be...

00:02:24.889 --> 00:02:26.652
...dismissed from their
positions as governors.

00:02:26.891 --> 00:02:28.791
Regardless of a blockade
or whatever else they try...

00:02:28.893 --> 00:02:30.918
...we're entering Koren
no matter what!

00:02:30.995 --> 00:02:33.520
There are nineteen days until
the swearing-in ceremony.

00:02:33.598 --> 00:02:35.463
And twenty till the deadline for
arriving for your assignment.

00:02:35.533 --> 00:02:39.196
Let's make sure we recover
your flower bud before that.

00:02:40.338 --> 00:02:43.603
People are anticipating a governor
with the flower bud of trust.

00:02:43.675 --> 00:02:47.509
For a province abandoned by the
central government for so long...

00:02:48.346 --> 00:02:50.314
...it's crucial that you get it back.

00:02:50.582 --> 00:02:53.483
In either case the Sa Clan is an
opponent we won't be able to avoid.

00:02:55.687 --> 00:02:57.951
Guess we'll have to
samba with the Sa!

00:03:01.826 --> 00:03:06.525
Uh... er, well... Something
smells delicious. Doesn't it?

00:03:06.598 --> 00:03:07.826
Y-You're right.

00:03:07.899 --> 00:03:10.197
Hey! That was funny,
don't you think?

00:03:10.268 --> 00:03:11.394
Hey! Hey!

00:03:11.469 --> 00:03:13.061
Regardless of what follows...

00:03:13.137 --> 00:03:16.937
...first we must get past
that blocked gate to get anywhere.

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:21.238
But before that, let's have
a little something to eat!

00:03:23.481 --> 00:03:25.346
Meanwhile, there was a person
other than Shurei's group...

00:03:25.416 --> 00:03:26.644
...heading towards Koren.

00:03:27.185 --> 00:03:30.154
The Sa Clan's youngest son,
Kokujun Sa.

00:03:31.222 --> 00:03:33.554
With a mere handful of courage...

00:03:33.691 --> 00:03:36.319
...he's trying to create a path to
the future for someone he loves.

00:03:46.237 --> 00:03:49.172
Shunki. What's wrong?
Need to use the bathroom?

00:03:57.849 --> 00:03:59.248
Here, Shunki.

00:04:03.054 --> 00:04:07.184
The man known as Hokuto was
an irreplaceable friend to me.

00:04:08.192 --> 00:04:10.752
Lord Shoka!
Allow me to pour the tea.

00:04:11.362 --> 00:04:14.024
It's all right.
Shusui, please have a seat.

00:04:14.299 --> 00:04:15.425
Yes.

00:04:16.367 --> 00:04:19.427
Just once, I received a letter
from Hokuto.

00:04:19.904 --> 00:04:22.839
It said, "I'll come see you some day
so until then, don't come visit me."

00:04:24.542 --> 00:04:26.976
I waited a long time
for that day to come, but...!

00:04:27.845 --> 00:04:32.077
In the end, he passed away quietly
while under the care of his children.

00:04:32.684 --> 00:04:34.652
If you knew that man of many years
ago, the last thing you'd expect...

00:04:34.719 --> 00:04:37.552
...would be for him to pass away
quietly due to illness.

00:04:37.622 --> 00:04:39.590
As members of the
"Wolves of the Wind"...

00:04:39.657 --> 00:04:43.855
...there were countless times when
we'd entrust our lives to each other...

00:04:43.928 --> 00:04:45.623
...as we walked a path of
darkness.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:49.058
I'm glad that at least in the end,
he was able to die peacefully.

00:04:49.334 --> 00:04:50.460
Lord Shoka...

00:04:50.535 --> 00:04:53.333
...were you the one who looked
after the two sons he'd left behind?

00:04:53.905 --> 00:04:56.396
Hokuto did such a magnificent
job raising them...

00:04:56.474 --> 00:04:59.409
...there wasn't much I needed to do.

00:05:00.111 --> 00:05:02.602
They're the sons of the
Bald Eagle of Sa Province.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:05.012
They're sure to soar
strongly through the skies.

00:05:05.083 --> 00:05:06.948
Yes, definitely.

00:05:10.488 --> 00:05:12.956
Shusui. Is it too bitter?

00:05:13.291 --> 00:05:15.759
No. It's quite tasty.

00:05:18.563 --> 00:05:21.589
I'm glad that our father taught us
how to read and write!

00:05:21.866 --> 00:05:25.097
Thanks to that, we can communicate
with Miss Shunki like this!

00:05:27.438 --> 00:05:28.598
Starting this moment...

00:05:28.673 --> 00:05:30.265
...I'm heading down
the mountain.

00:05:32.243 --> 00:05:32.732
Yoshun!

00:05:33.177 --> 00:05:34.269
Yes, big brother!

00:05:34.345 --> 00:05:36.438
You fool! Call me boss!

00:05:36.514 --> 00:05:38.675
You know what you're
supposed to do now, right?

00:05:38.916 --> 00:05:40.645
Of course! We have to get packing!

00:05:40.718 --> 00:05:42.845
That's correct!
We hereby declare our revival...

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:47.016
...as the second generation of the
"Bald Eagles of Sa Province"!

00:05:47.158 --> 00:05:49.319
Wow, you're awesome, boss!

00:05:49.627 --> 00:05:52.960
I'll pack some freshly picked
fruits right away!

00:05:53.297 --> 00:05:56.130
Okay! Let's continue what our
father began. The legend of the...

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:59.033
...second generation of chivalrous
thieves begins here!

00:05:59.103 --> 00:06:03.335
Yes! And I'll write everything down in
my leaf diaries so that we won't forget!

00:06:03.908 --> 00:06:04.875
Yeah!

00:06:10.214 --> 00:06:11.909
What is it, Shunki?

00:06:14.952 --> 00:06:16.180
I...

00:06:16.487 --> 00:06:17.818
...will go alone.

00:06:21.059 --> 00:06:23.027
A journey is all about the company!

00:06:23.327 --> 00:06:25.795
You'd better use the bathroom
before we leave, Miss Shunki.

00:06:25.863 --> 00:06:27.831
There's no need to be embarrassed.

00:06:34.772 --> 00:06:36.831
This is delicious, Shurei!

00:06:37.742 --> 00:06:39.573
It has a good flavor, doesn't it?

00:06:39.644 --> 00:06:42.135
Seiran, yours is bigger than mine.

00:06:43.648 --> 00:06:46.549
It's so sad to think that
you're the former governor!

00:06:47.185 --> 00:06:50.120
Well, putting that aside,
what should we do?

00:06:51.022 --> 00:06:54.514
If Ryuren Ran were here, things
would be so much simpler.

00:06:55.226 --> 00:06:57.660
Because of the Ran Clan crest,
the Twin Dragons.

00:06:58.162 --> 00:07:01.131
Right. All we'd have to say is
"Look at this token!" and we'd all...

00:07:01.199 --> 00:07:04.396
...pass this gate without
being inspected, but...!

00:07:04.469 --> 00:07:06.266
If he's not here,
it's not an option.

00:07:06.871 --> 00:07:07.860
That's right.

00:07:08.673 --> 00:07:12.268
So, what will you do?
How will we enter Koren?

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:16.906
Why, we should just walk right
through the front gate, simple as that.

00:07:17.415 --> 00:07:20.509
I'm sure I reported to you earlier,
that even the gate guards...

00:07:20.918 --> 00:07:23.318
...have been replaced with
the Sa Clan private army.

00:07:23.721 --> 00:07:25.552
But that's illegal.

00:07:25.623 --> 00:07:27.921
In that case, Seiran can use
his authority to arrest them...

00:07:28.025 --> 00:07:30.459
...and after pushing them to the side,
there won't be anything to keep us...

00:07:30.595 --> 00:07:32.563
...from boldly walking
through that gate.

00:07:33.231 --> 00:07:36.223
Am I wrong? Is there a
problem with that idea?

00:07:37.235 --> 00:07:39.601
I see. No problem.

00:07:40.204 --> 00:07:42.172
With regards to my flower bud...

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:45.366
...I'm sure he will approach us in
some manner when we enter Koren.

00:07:45.676 --> 00:07:48.144
Huh? Then all that's
left to do is sleep.

00:07:48.412 --> 00:07:52.212
That's right, Eigetsu. Food
and sleep are always necessary.

00:07:54.152 --> 00:07:58.111
Well, I'll go to sleep first.
Just make sure you put out the fire.

00:07:58.689 --> 00:08:00.156
Good night.

00:08:03.327 --> 00:08:07.491
Hey, Sho. Our superiors are amazing,
don't you think? They're the best!

00:08:08.132 --> 00:08:09.326
Indeed.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:10.492
They'll become governors...

00:08:10.568 --> 00:08:12.900
...who won't take a back
seat to the previous one.

00:08:20.611 --> 00:08:23.341
The way things look, we'll reach
our goal, Kinka, in a wink!

00:08:23.781 --> 00:08:25.749
For us, the Bald Eagles
of Sa Province...

00:08:25.816 --> 00:08:28.148
...mountains like this are a
piece of cake, right boss?!

00:08:28.452 --> 00:08:30.443
Oh yeah!

00:08:32.456 --> 00:08:35.323
Miss Shunki. Hold on to me tightly!

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:37.987
Let's go!

00:08:47.405 --> 00:08:49.373
It's really blocked!

00:08:49.607 --> 00:08:51.666
We've gotta go through,
no matter what!

00:08:57.715 --> 00:08:58.773
What's that?

00:08:59.217 --> 00:09:00.275
Well, shall we do it?

00:09:00.351 --> 00:09:01.318
Yeah.

00:09:04.589 --> 00:09:06.557
Checkpoint-breakers?

00:09:18.336 --> 00:09:20.497
Okay then. Let's get
this stamped, already.

00:09:22.773 --> 00:09:25.571
Hey, you seem awfully used to
this sort of stuff, Ensei.

00:09:26.043 --> 00:09:28.011
You're really accustomed
to doing this.

00:09:29.247 --> 00:09:31.477
Accustomed to breaking
through checkpoints?

00:09:31.549 --> 00:09:34.017
You're the governors' aide,
for heaven's sake.

00:09:34.552 --> 00:09:37.146
Hey, Sho. Can you ride a horse?

00:09:37.488 --> 00:09:39.456
Yes, to an extent.

00:09:39.624 --> 00:09:41.751
Could we head over to
your sister's residence?

00:09:41.826 --> 00:09:44.590
Actually, we really have no other
place to go, so we're going there.

00:09:53.838 --> 00:09:57.103
W-Wait a minute! Why a
horse all of a sudden?!

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.650
It must have been tough for you.

00:10:07.718 --> 00:10:10.084
Not only did you have no saddle,
we added a little speed.

00:10:10.154 --> 00:10:14.284
You call that a little?
My bum's hurting like crazy.

00:10:18.863 --> 00:10:20.592
Where are we?

00:10:21.365 --> 00:10:24.857
We're at Sho Sai's older sister,
Rin's residence.

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:27.638
Sho Sai's older sister.

00:10:27.772 --> 00:10:29.740
The garden and the residence
are rather ordinary...

00:10:29.807 --> 00:10:31.570
...but it has a very
fashionable flavor to it.

00:10:31.642 --> 00:10:34.805
I can see that his sister is
someone with excellent taste.

00:10:35.479 --> 00:10:40.143
Come on in. I'm sure my sister
will have left a letter for us.

00:10:58.302 --> 00:11:00.600
"To the two honorable
new governors"...!

00:11:01.872 --> 00:11:04.602
How did she know that
we'd be coming here?

00:11:04.975 --> 00:11:06.966
One necessary ability
for a merchant...

00:11:07.044 --> 00:11:09.911
...is to correctly predict
the future, Governor Hong.

00:11:10.648 --> 00:11:14.049
Like Assistant Ro said, this is
the only place where we can go.

00:11:14.618 --> 00:11:18.110
It's no fluke that she's the provincial
leader of the Merchants Guild.

00:11:18.823 --> 00:11:20.791
And the other one?

00:11:27.064 --> 00:11:28.429
Sh-Shurei!

00:11:28.666 --> 00:11:31.601
Th-This is... an invitation
from the Sa Clan!

00:11:33.037 --> 00:11:37.997
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:41.512 --> 00:11:44.242
Wait. We'll worry about that one first.

00:11:44.682 --> 00:11:46.172
S-Sure.

00:11:48.819 --> 00:11:52.687
The Sa Clan has caused many
disruptions within Sa Province.

00:11:53.057 --> 00:11:56.356
Since the Sa Clan even has a
grip on the Merchants Guild...

00:11:56.827 --> 00:11:59.295
...the guild is only able to provide
us with minimal assistance.

00:12:00.898 --> 00:12:02.866
So, what will you do now?

00:12:03.601 --> 00:12:06.069
Don't forget that the actions
of the Merchants Guild...

00:12:06.137 --> 00:12:08.697
...will vary, depending on your strategy.

00:12:08.873 --> 00:12:10.841
Whoa! You're merciless!

00:12:11.242 --> 00:12:13.710
Since both you and Officer
Si seem to be soft on them...

00:12:14.044 --> 00:12:16.512
...you need someone like me
to balance things out.

00:12:25.423 --> 00:12:29.450
Eigetsu. I think we ought to
use the governor's seal here.

00:12:30.327 --> 00:12:32.295
Yes. I think so too.

00:12:33.063 --> 00:12:36.055
The Merchants Guild will provide
us with minimal assistance, right?

00:12:36.734 --> 00:12:38.702
If at all possible.

00:12:48.345 --> 00:12:50.677
Please send the reply to
Miss Rin Sai...

00:12:51.282 --> 00:12:53.546
...head of the Sa Province
branch of the Merchants Guild.

00:12:53.617 --> 00:12:55.949
We hereby request immediate
military assistance...

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:59.183
...from all soldiers affiliated with
the Merchants Guild of Sa Province.

00:13:01.892 --> 00:13:04.360
Soldiers are to take action to control
all conflicts that have arisen...

00:13:04.462 --> 00:13:07.431
...as well as protect all
mayors who will be present...

00:13:07.731 --> 00:13:10.359
...at the swearing-in ceremony
of the new governors.

00:13:11.635 --> 00:13:12.795
The above request is made...

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:15.395
...in the names of the Governors
of Sa Province...

00:13:15.473 --> 00:13:17.441
...Eigetsu To and Shurei Hong.

00:13:18.476 --> 00:13:20.444
However...

00:13:21.145 --> 00:13:22.874
There will be no reward money.

00:13:22.947 --> 00:13:25.415
We have no intention of buying your
conscience with money and goods.

00:13:26.116 --> 00:13:27.981
This is not an order.

00:13:28.052 --> 00:13:30.486
You shall use your own judgment on
whether or not you accept this request.

00:13:31.188 --> 00:13:33.986
Please provide us with a
reply as soon as possible.

00:13:34.825 --> 00:13:37.191
From Governor of Sa
Province, Eigetsu To.

00:13:39.463 --> 00:13:42.023
And Governor of Sa
Province, Shurei Hong.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:45.769
Eigetsu To
Shurei Hong

00:13:52.309 --> 00:13:53.435
It's missing something.

00:13:53.711 --> 00:13:54.769
What?!

00:13:54.879 --> 00:13:56.437
Wh-What's missing?

00:13:57.548 --> 00:14:00.415
Lieutenant Governor of Sa
Province, Ensei Ro, and...!

00:14:02.653 --> 00:14:04.848
Military Officer of
His Majesty, Seiran Si.

00:14:05.222 --> 00:14:07.690
Governor of Sa Province
Eigetsu To
Governor of Sa Province
Shurei Hong
Lieutenant Governor of Sa Province
Ensei Ro
Military Officer
Seiran Si

00:14:09.827 --> 00:14:11.795
You have no intention of
buying her conscience...

00:14:11.862 --> 00:14:13.420
...with money or goods, you say.

00:14:14.665 --> 00:14:18.032
Splendid! I'll deliver the letter
to my sister as soon as possible.

00:14:20.437 --> 00:14:22.098
No matter how you look at it...

00:14:22.172 --> 00:14:24.140
...having the Sa Province's army
on our side won't be enough.

00:14:24.208 --> 00:14:28.235
The soldiers of the Merchants Guild
are talented and have good leadership.

00:14:28.879 --> 00:14:29.538
But you know...

00:14:29.613 --> 00:14:32.844
...one would normally be too afraid
to bluntly request the services...

00:14:32.917 --> 00:14:36.353
...of the Merchants Guild
without any compensation.

00:14:40.891 --> 00:14:42.882
Please deliver this.

00:14:44.528 --> 00:14:49.465
Very well. And, are you not
going to open the other letter?

00:14:55.239 --> 00:14:58.208
You know, it has the feel
of a cursed invitation.

00:14:59.443 --> 00:15:03.243
It's a bad feeling, isn't it? But,
you have no choice but to open it!

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:11.288
Way to go! Women are brave!

00:15:14.525 --> 00:15:16.823
We hereby make
this announcement that...

00:15:16.894 --> 00:15:19.294
...all members of the clan will assemble
to officially select the clan's leader...

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:23.491
...followed by the Sa Clan appointment
ceremony later the same day.

00:15:24.468 --> 00:15:26.868
We therefore request the
attendance of the two new governors...

00:15:26.937 --> 00:15:28.632
...to partake in this glorious occasion...

00:15:28.706 --> 00:15:31.641
...as well as to formally
acknowledge the head of the clan.

00:15:31.942 --> 00:15:34.638
We look forward to seeing you there.

00:15:38.282 --> 00:15:40.045
It has trap written all over it.

00:15:40.117 --> 00:15:42.745
In a nutshell, they're saying,
"Now, come to me!"

00:15:42.953 --> 00:15:46.252
In any case, the timing
couldn't be worse.

00:15:48.525 --> 00:15:52.086
I-Isn't this another one of those tackle
it head on, fair and square deals?

00:15:52.963 --> 00:15:56.922
They've gotta be joking. It's on the day
before our swearing-in ceremony?!

00:15:57.568 --> 00:15:59.092
Then will you turn
him down?

00:15:59.203 --> 00:16:00.830
Of course we'll go!

00:16:01.238 --> 00:16:03.706
I must get back my flower
bud that was taken from me.

00:16:03.874 --> 00:16:05.842
And then there's the
matter of Kokujun.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:09.407
You could call it a flowered
invitation with the bud as bait.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:13.106
He sent you this letter knowing very
well that you couldn't turn it down.

00:16:13.717 --> 00:16:15.708
That's why I'm so mad about it!!

00:16:24.495 --> 00:16:27.123
Sho Sai. Were you able to get
the thing that I asked you for?

00:16:28.065 --> 00:16:30.556
There's nothing that the
Merchants Guild cannot get.

00:16:32.202 --> 00:16:33.999
Here's the promised item.

00:16:39.476 --> 00:16:41.774
Indeed. Thank you for your help.

00:16:42.379 --> 00:16:45.712
You're so knowledgeable
in poisons it's amazing.

00:16:46.183 --> 00:16:48.651
I was stunned that you'd know
about things that spread secretly...

00:16:48.719 --> 00:16:51.279
...in the underground of common life.

00:16:52.256 --> 00:16:54.724
It's not something that
you need to know about.

00:16:55.225 --> 00:16:57.489
It's not as if I learned
about it because I wanted to.

00:16:58.696 --> 00:17:01.164
You intend to take it
upon yourself to use that?

00:17:01.231 --> 00:17:03.699
You're very nosy for a merchant.

00:17:04.101 --> 00:17:06.592
Well, I say you're overdoing
it for a military officer.

00:17:08.272 --> 00:17:10.240
My position is a bit different.

00:17:10.374 --> 00:17:13.138
I'm a man upon whom the Kansho
has been bestowed by His Majesty.

00:17:13.911 --> 00:17:17.039
I have an obligation to protect
the governors from any danger.

00:17:18.115 --> 00:17:20.015
Besides, Ensei...

00:17:21.952 --> 00:17:24.352
He's a man who's always
walking under the sun.

00:17:24.421 --> 00:17:26.889
No matter how the tentacles of
darkness try to wrap around him...

00:17:26.957 --> 00:17:29.653
...he'll manage to get away from them.
He'll never be bothered by dark nights.

00:17:30.761 --> 00:17:33.821
For that reason, Sakujun Sa is
not a suitable opponent for him.

00:17:34.665 --> 00:17:36.326
And you're different?

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:39.264
I'm the exact opposite of Ensei.

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:43.168
I know how to handle those types
of men better than anyone else.

00:17:44.541 --> 00:17:48.033
How to deal with an opponent whom
I can neither kill nor leave alive.

00:17:49.947 --> 00:17:51.915
I was exactly that in the past.

00:17:52.182 --> 00:17:54.207
I was the troublesome second prince
whom they could neither kill...

00:17:54.284 --> 00:17:55.717
...nor leave alive.

00:17:58.355 --> 00:18:00.323
You're the real king, aren't you?

00:18:05.095 --> 00:18:08.496
You speak in the manner of someone
who walks the path of a conqueror.

00:18:09.032 --> 00:18:09.999
Are you saying that...

00:18:10.067 --> 00:18:13.230
...to you, light and darkness are
neither hope nor despair...

00:18:14.037 --> 00:18:15.095
...but nothing more than tactics...

00:18:15.172 --> 00:18:17.504
...used for the purpose of
accomplishing your goals?

00:18:19.676 --> 00:18:21.610
I've said too much.

00:18:21.678 --> 00:18:24.841
I shall continue to deliver to you the
requested information and potions...

00:18:24.982 --> 00:18:26.950
...as soon as I receive them.

00:18:28.852 --> 00:18:30.820
Thank you very much.

00:18:41.198 --> 00:18:45.396
Whether it be light or darkness, I'll
take advantage of anything I can use.

00:18:47.171 --> 00:18:49.401
Seiran! Seiran!

00:18:51.408 --> 00:18:53.876
In order to protect what
I ought to be protecting.

00:18:58.282 --> 00:19:00.648
Grandfather! Stop it, already!

00:19:00.984 --> 00:19:02.952
It's still not too late to undo
your mistakes!

00:19:07.291 --> 00:19:11.387
We must atone for the sins that
the Sa Clan has accumulated!

00:19:12.162 --> 00:19:14.392
Of course I, for one,
will also bear the responsibility!

00:19:15.999 --> 00:19:18.968
You are a disgrace,
who fails to show pride in this clan!

00:19:19.036 --> 00:19:20.560
Forgetting honesty, righteousness,
reason and control...

00:19:20.637 --> 00:19:21.501
you've let desire take over...

00:19:21.572 --> 00:19:23.164
...and don't realize how
soiled you've become.

00:19:23.240 --> 00:19:24.707
That's much more of a disgrace!

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:29.140
You can show your true pride in the
Sa Clan by putting a stop to this...

00:19:29.213 --> 00:19:30.805
...before you fall endlessly
into the depths.

00:19:30.881 --> 00:19:33.247
It's time we return to
the correct path!

00:19:34.318 --> 00:19:38.084
Pride in the Sa Clan, you say?
How dare you talk like you know it all!

00:19:42.659 --> 00:19:43.683
Grandfather!

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:47.696
Meeting with you on
a whim was a mistake.

00:19:48.031 --> 00:19:51.592
I should've stuck you into the same
place as that man, right from the start.

00:19:53.437 --> 00:19:55.632
The place I put your father.

00:19:55.706 --> 00:19:56.400
Father?

00:19:58.742 --> 00:20:01.302
Are you telling me that
father hasn't been...

00:20:01.578 --> 00:20:04.445
...recuperating from an illness in a
far-off place so that he'd get better?

00:20:05.349 --> 00:20:07.317
That's what makes you foolish.

00:20:07.684 --> 00:20:11.643
That man sits in his prison,
not even knowing who he is.

00:20:11.989 --> 00:20:15.390
That's... That's absolutely cruel of you.

00:20:15.959 --> 00:20:18.621
I'll allow you to take part in the
selection ceremony. Take him away!

00:20:19.162 --> 00:20:20.356
Grandfather!

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:23.695
You've long admired my
elder brother, Enjun.

00:20:23.934 --> 00:20:26.664
Listen, even if you did
have intentions of leading...

00:20:26.737 --> 00:20:29.205
...I will inherit that position
from my brother first.

00:20:29.706 --> 00:20:33.972
Wh-What are you trying
to do? Grandfather!

00:20:35.512 --> 00:20:37.480
Come!

00:20:43.253 --> 00:20:47.553
Eiki. If you desire, I could
free you from here right now.

00:20:48.725 --> 00:20:51.956
Sho. You're now this
snobbish Advisor Sho.

00:20:52.296 --> 00:20:54.924
Amazing that an old man like you
would come here with that appearance.

00:20:54.998 --> 00:20:56.590
You wily beast-monster in
a young man's skin.

00:20:56.667 --> 00:20:59.465
I would never take help from you.

00:21:01.571 --> 00:21:02.936
I have one question.

00:21:03.006 --> 00:21:05.270
Where is the head of
the Sa Clan's ring...

00:21:05.342 --> 00:21:07.435
...that you stole a year
and a half ago?

00:21:08.078 --> 00:21:11.479
Stole? The ring will
return here before long.

00:21:12.182 --> 00:21:15.208
Is that right? Now that I know that,
I have nothing to talk to you about.

00:21:15.719 --> 00:21:17.687
Now, vanish from my sight.

00:21:18.021 --> 00:21:19.215
Eiki.

00:21:19.523 --> 00:21:21.991
It would be easy for me to
leave here and take over...

00:21:22.059 --> 00:21:24.789
...collectively kicking
the asses of those fools.

00:21:25.595 --> 00:21:27.756
But then what happens after I die?

00:21:28.332 --> 00:21:31.597
Aged folks like me should stick to just
giving whatever knowledge...

00:21:31.668 --> 00:21:33.636
...is requested and
provide guidance.

00:21:33.937 --> 00:21:35.905
That's why I remain here waiting.

00:21:36.206 --> 00:21:40.165
Right now, I'm in the midst of the
most significant challenge of my life.

00:21:41.311 --> 00:21:42.903
What are the chances of victory?

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:44.311
Men are useless...

00:21:44.381 --> 00:21:46.372
...because they spend all their time
thinking about stuff like that!

00:21:52.322 --> 00:21:53.983
Maybe our pace was too fast.

00:21:54.124 --> 00:21:55.989
Are you all right, Shunki?

00:21:58.595 --> 00:22:00.563
Shunki?

00:22:02.099 --> 00:22:04.067
You boys and girl over there.

00:22:05.035 --> 00:22:07.265
You youngsters.
Where are you going?

00:22:08.405 --> 00:22:12.205
Um... well... K-Kinka.
And after that, Koren.

00:22:13.043 --> 00:22:14.977
Wow, he's cool!

00:22:15.812 --> 00:22:18.007
In that case you shall
accept my charity.

00:22:23.387 --> 00:22:25.787
You don't need to thank me.
I wish you happiness.

00:22:26.757 --> 00:22:27.724
Now, as a farewell gift...

00:22:27.791 --> 00:22:30.624
...I will play you a tune that just
came to me this moment.

00:22:37.367 --> 00:22:41.133
So as long as we have this token
that the super cool guy gave us...

00:22:41.571 --> 00:22:43.869
...we can enter Koren without
having to go through Kinka.

00:22:44.341 --> 00:22:46.809
But Ensei requested that
before going to Koren...

00:22:46.877 --> 00:22:49.505
...we first have a word with
an important man in Kinka.

00:22:49.846 --> 00:22:51.780
Then I'll run to Kinka quickly!

00:22:51.848 --> 00:22:54.373
And I'll go ahead to
Koren with Miss Shunki!

00:22:54.885 --> 00:22:56.512
Let's go!

00:23:01.758 --> 00:23:05.023
Listen, Shunki. This is a promise
between you and your grandmother.

00:23:05.662 --> 00:23:09.029
Use your power only for
the sake of one person.

00:23:11.601 --> 00:23:13.660
I shall seal your voice!

00:23:25.749 --> 00:23:27.979
I'm going. You just wait there.

00:23:30.587 --> 00:23:35.684
Itsumo sugoku jiyu na anata ha ima

00:23:35.892 --> 00:23:42.229
Kono ame no naka donna
Yume wo oikaketeiruno

00:23:42.532 --> 00:23:47.492
Dokokade kodoku to tatakainagara

00:23:47.704 --> 00:23:52.801
Namida mo gaman shiterundarou

00:23:53.810 --> 00:23:58.213
Hitori demo daijobu to

00:23:59.749 --> 00:24:04.880
Anata mo watashi to onaji

00:24:05.655 --> 00:24:16.224
Tomawari bakari dakedo
Nazeka kono michi ga suki de

00:24:17.100 --> 00:24:22.697
Shiawase da toka ureshii toki ha

00:24:23.106 --> 00:24:28.169
Anata no koto wo omoidasu kara

00:24:29.045 --> 00:24:34.608
Iroazayaka na kisetsu ha kitto

00:24:34.985 --> 00:24:41.788
Kono omoi todoketekureru

00:24:45.095 --> 00:24:45.695
Next Episode

00:24:45.695 --> 00:24:47.130
Next Episode
We've entered Koren.

00:24:47.130 --> 00:24:47.164
Next Episode

00:24:47.164 --> 00:24:49.866
Next Episode
A Diamond in the Rough
I'm going straight to the place where
that man of the Sa Clan is!

00:24:49.866 --> 00:24:49.900
Next Episode
A Diamond in the Rough

00:24:49.900 --> 00:24:52.302
Next Episode
A Diamond in the Rough
I'll find Lady Eiki and the others, and...

00:24:52.302 --> 00:24:52.502
Next Episode
A Diamond in the Rough

00:24:52.502 --> 00:24:54.470
Next Episode
A Diamond in the Rough
Wait. What are you doing here?

00:24:55.472 --> 00:24:57.497
You've come to get me?
